WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:06.520
Dr. Levy placed three different cans of Coca-Cola
soda into SCP-914, the Clockworks, in different

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.509
settings, just to see what would happen.

00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:14.230
On rough, it became a small pile of aluminum
filings, sugar, and a puff of water vapor.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:20.039
On Coarse, it became a can of Tesco-Brand
Cola - A Brand-X from a low-cost British supermarket.

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:22.990
On 1:1, it became a can of Pepsi-brand Cola.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.189
But do you think it’s right on that one?

00:00:25.189 --> 00:00:27.599
Which is better, Pepsi or Coke?

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:28.289
Fight!

